; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
;  $60  sprite zero.  One opaque row, in the colour the palette makes equal to
;       the backdrop, so it is invisible in both day and night -- it exists
;       only so the PPU flags the scanline where the score bar ends.
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
@tile SPR0_MARK $60
